{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "Applies to Claude CLI, Codex CLI, OpenCode TUI/Desktop and Qwen idle records. Other readers manage their own lifetime. Idle never fills the island.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"适用于 Claude CLI、Codex CLI、OpenCode TUI/桌面版和 Qwen 的空闲记录。其他读取器自行管理保留时间；空闲任务不会占据主岛。"}}}},
    "Sound import failed: %@. The previous sound could not be restored: %@. Recovery copy: %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"声音导入失败：%@。旧声音未能恢复：%@。恢复副本：%@"}}}},
    "The task target has closed or changed. Refresh tasks and try again.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任务目标已关闭或发生变化，请刷新任务后重试。"}}}},
    "Allow LoopFwd to control this terminal in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Automation, then try again.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 自动化中允许 LoopFwd 控制此终端，然后重试。"}}}},
    "The return helper timed out. Check that the target app is responding, then try again.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回操作超时，请确认目标应用能正常响应后重试。"}}}},
    "The target application could not be opened. Review its location in Agents settings.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法打开目标应用，请在 Agent 设置中检查其位置。"}}}},
    "The return helper failed. Open the task manually and review Setup status.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回操作失败，请手动打开任务，并查看配置检查。"}}}},
    "Refresh tasks": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"刷新任务"}}}},
    "Review access": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查权限"}}}},
    "Enable this integration in Agents when you want to use it.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要使用时，请在 Agent 设置中启用此接入。"}}}},
    "Data folder unavailable": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据目录不可用"}}}},
    "The selected data folder is missing. Choose its current location in Agents.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选数据目录不存在，请在 Agent 设置中重新选择当前位置。"}}}},
    "Data temporarily unavailable": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据暂不可用"}}}},
    "Review Diagnostics for the failed source, then refresh after correcting it.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在诊断中查看出错的数据源，修正后再刷新。"}}}},
    "Only process data is available. Review the observer and its configuration in Integrations.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前仅有进程数据，请在集成设置中检查观察器及其配置。"}}}},
    "Only process data is available. Review the data source in Diagnostics.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前仅有进程数据，请在诊断中检查数据源。"}}}},
    "The source was read successfully. Start a task in the provider to see it here.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已成功读取数据源；在对应产品中开始任务后，即可在这里看到。"}}}},
    "CLI or app not found": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未找到 CLI 或应用"}}}},
    "Install the official provider, or choose an existing CLI in Agents.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请安装官方产品，或在 Agent 设置中选择已有的 CLI。"}}}},
    "Start a task in the provider, then refresh status. Installation alone does not verify observation.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在对应产品中开始任务后刷新状态；已安装并不代表观察功能已验证。"}}}},
    "No current usage report": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂无当前额度报告"}}}},
    "Expired windows are hidden. Usage follows the observed Codex data folder; select one in Agents if multiple accounts are running.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已隐藏过期窗口。额度读取与被观察的 Codex 数据目录一致；多账户同时运行时，请在 Agent 设置中指定目录。"}}}},
    "Unknown": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未知"}}}},
    "Unsupported Claude hook layout. Settings were left unchanged.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"不支持此 Claude Hook 配置结构，原配置保持不变。"}}}},
    "Data directory unavailable. Choose it in Agents settings.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法确定数据目录，请在 Agent 设置中选择。"}}}},
    "Multiple data directories found. Choose one in Agents settings.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"发现多个数据目录，请在 Agent 设置中明确选择。"}}}},
    "Data directory must be an absolute path.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据目录必须是绝对路径。"}}}},
    "Invalid Claude settings. Nothing was changed.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Claude 配置无效，未做任何修改。"}}}},
    "Claude settings must be a regular file, not a symbolic link.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Claude 配置必须是普通文件，不能是符号链接。"}}}},
    "Another hook operation may be running. Review the lock before retrying.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可能有其他 Hook 操作正在运行，请检查锁文件后再试。"}}}},
    "Settings changed during installation. Newer changes were preserved.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"安装期间配置发生变化，已保留较新的修改。"}}}},
    "Hook operation failed; previous files restored. Backup: %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hook 操作失败，先前文件已恢复。备份：%@"}}}},
    "Hook operation failed; review files and backup before retrying: %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hook 操作失败，请检查文件及备份后再试：%@"}}}},
    "Codex Desktop data": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex 桌面版数据"}}}},
    "Automatic uses the running Codex app's environment. Choose its actual CODEX_HOME folder if detection is unavailable or ambiguous. This does not move or modify Codex data.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动模式读取正在运行的 Codex 应用环境。无法检测或有多个候选时，请选择实际 CODEX_HOME 目录；不会移动或修改 Codex 数据。"}}}},
    "Data directory": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"数据目录"}}}},
    "Automatic · observed app environment": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动 · 被观察应用的环境"}}}},
    "Choose folder…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择文件夹…"}}}},
    "Use automatic": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用自动检测"}}}},
    "Use default": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"使用默认目录"}}}},
    "Running now · %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在运行 · %@"}}}},
    "Installed · %@ · %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装 · %@ · %@"}}}},
    "CLI not found · %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未找到 CLI · %@"}}}},
    "local session reader": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本机会话读取"}}}},
    "process tracking": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"进程检测"}}}},
    "Installs attention hooks only in the settings file shown below, after writing a private backup. Choosing a folder does not install anything.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅在下方显示的配置文件中安装注意力 Hook，修改前保留私有备份。选择文件夹本身不会安装。"}}}},
    "Claude settings target": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Claude 配置目标"}}}},
    "Each operation retains its own private recovery copy.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"每次操作均保留独立的私有恢复副本。"}}}},
    "Experimental session-addressed input only. Terminal.app remains return-only.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅实验性支持会话定向输入；Terminal.app 只支持返回。"}}}},
    "Return only. Global keyboard input is disabled to prevent sending to the wrong window.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅支持返回。已关闭全局键盘输入，防止发送到错误窗口。"}}}},
    "Return only · keyboard injection disabled": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅支持返回 · 键盘注入已关闭"}}}},
    "LoopFwd, %d tasks need attention": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LoopFwd，%d 个任务需要处理"}}}},
    "LoopFwd, %d active tasks": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LoopFwd，%d 个活跃任务"}}}},
    "Observed version: %@": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察到的版本：%@"}}}},
    "Not scanned": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"尚未扫描"}}}},
    "%d cache hits": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 次缓存命中"}}}},
    "Cache unknown": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"缓存情况未知"}}}},
    "Preview tested": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览实测"}}}},
    "%d integrations · %d preview-tested surfaces": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d 款接入 · %d 个表面已做预览实测"}}}},
    "Preview tested means basic real-task monitoring was checked on a specific surface, not every feature or environment. Other integrations are optional experiments; enable only what you use.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"预览实测表示已检查特定运行表面的基础任务监控，不代表全部功能或环境均通过。其他接入是可选实验，请只启用自己使用的产品。"}}}},
    "Basic monitoring tested on the listed surface; return and controls vary by session.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所列表面已做基础监控实测；返回与控制能力以具体会话为准。"}}}},
    "Optional CLI integration. Enable in Agents; observer setup may be required. Real model tasks are not yet verified.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"可选 CLI 接入，请在 Agent 中启用，可能需要配置观察器。真实模型任务尚未验证。"}}}},
    "Installed does not mean configured or tested on this Mac.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已安装不代表已配置，也不代表已在此 Mac 上验证。"}}}},
    "Disabled in Agents": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未在 Agent 中启用"}}}},
    "Kimi Code observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kimi Code 观察器"}}}},
    "Read-only session observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只读会话观察器"}}}},
    "Select the KIMI_CODE_HOME folder": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 KIMI_CODE_HOME 数据目录"}}}},
    "Select Python 3.11 or newer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 Python 3.11 或更新版本"}}}},
    "Requires Kimi Code 0.41.0, Node.js 24+ and Python 3.11+. Lifecycle hooks identify sessions; task state comes from the matching main wire. No approval or exact session return is promised. Configuration is backed up before changes.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要 Kimi Code 0.41.0、Node.js 24+ 和 Python 3.11+。生命周期 Hook 只识别会话，任务状态读取对应主会话记录。不承诺审批或精确返回会话，修改配置前先备份。"}}}},
    "Kimi session cannot be selected precisely": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法精确选择此 Kimi 会话"}}}},
    "Kimi session lifecycle heartbeat is stale": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kimi 会话生命周期心跳已过期"}}}},
    "Kimi lifecycle identity or data root is incompatible": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kimi 生命周期身份或数据目录不匹配"}}}},
    "Kimi lifecycle session has no matching readable main wire": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kimi 会话没有匹配的可读主记录"}}}},
    "WorkBuddy desktop observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"WorkBuddy 桌面观察器"}}}},
    "Install WorkBuddy 5.5.3 first": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先安装 WorkBuddy 5.5.3"}}}},
    "Observer configured. Restart WorkBuddy to load the hooks.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器已配置，请重启 WorkBuddy 以加载 Hook。"}}}},
    "Observer events detected · experimental": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已检测到观察事件 · 实验支持"}}}},
    "Observer configured · restart WorkBuddy if needed": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器已配置 · 必要时重启 WorkBuddy"}}}},
    "Desktop · versioned Hook observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"桌面应用 · 版本化 Hook 观察器"}}}},
    "Experimental tool progress and session return. Install the observer in Integrations.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"实验性工具进展观察与会话返回。请在“集成”中安装观察器。"}}}},
    "Requires WorkBuddy 5.5.3 with bundled CLI 2.137.1 and Node 24+. Select the WorkBuddy configuration folder (normally ~/.workbuddy, or your WORKBUDDY_CONFIG_DIR). Existing hooks are backed up and preserved. Only short-term tool progress and session return are supported; approvals and successful goal completion are not confirmed.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要 WorkBuddy 5.5.3（内置 CLI 2.137.1）及 Node 24+。请选择 WorkBuddy 配置目录，通常是 ~/.workbuddy 或自定义 WORKBUDDY_CONFIG_DIR。原有 Hook 会备份并保留。目前只支持短时工具进展观察和会话返回，尚不能确认审批与目标成功完成。"}}}},
    "Desktop installed · observer setup required": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"桌面应用已安装 · 需要配置观察器"}}}},
    "Desktop app not found": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未发现桌面应用"}}}},
    "Gemini CLI observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gemini CLI 观察器"}}}},
    "Qwen Code observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Qwen Code 观察器"}}}},
    "Cursor CLI observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cursor CLI 观察器"}}}},
    "Remove or recover the existing observer before choosing another folder.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先移除或恢复现有观察器，再选择其他配置目录。"}}}},
    "Read-only event observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只读事件观察器"}}}},
    "Cursor uses ~/.cursor/hooks.json or <project>/.cursor/hooks.json, independent of CURSOR_CONFIG_DIR. Only identity and output events are observed; busy, completion and approvals are not confirmed. Existing hooks are preserved and backed up.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cursor 使用 ~/.cursor/hooks.json 或 <项目>/.cursor/hooks.json，与 CURSOR_CONFIG_DIR 无关。目前只观察身份与输出事件，不能确认正在执行、完成或审批状态。原有 Hook 会保留并备份。"}}}},
    "Read-only stream observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只读进展观察器"}}}},
    "Choose a configuration folder to set up observation": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择配置目录以设置观察器"}}}},
    "Choose the official CLI in Agents first": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先在 Agent 设置中选择官方 CLI"}}}},
    "Select the provider configuration folder": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择该 Agent 的配置目录"}}}},
    "Observer resources are unavailable": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器资源不可用，请重新安装 LoopFwd"}}}},
    "Observer configured. Restart the CLI; workspace trust may still be required.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器已配置，请重启 CLI。可能仍需信任当前工作目录。"}}}},
    "Observer is not configured": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器未配置"}}}},
    "Hooks are disabled in the selected settings. No disable switches were changed.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"所选配置已禁用 Hook，未更改你的禁用设置。"}}}},
    "Observer setup is incomplete. Reinstall to repair it, or remove it.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器配置不完整，请重新安装以修复，或移除配置。"}}}},
    "Reinstall": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新安装"}}}},
    "Review settings and backups before retrying an interrupted operation": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中断操作后，请先检查当前配置和备份再重试"}}}},
    "Choose the provider settings folder explicitly. Existing hooks and comments are preserved, settings are backed up, and disabled hooks stay disabled. Observation only; no approvals or successful completion guarantees.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请明确选择该 Agent 的配置目录。保留已有 Hook 与注释，修改前备份，已禁用的 Hook 保持禁用。仅观察进展，不提供审批，也不保证能确认任务成功。"}}}},
    "Tool result received; the next execution stage is not confirmed": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已收到工具结果，尚不能确认下一执行阶段"}}}},
    "Qwen session switch is waiting for registry reconciliation": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Qwen 正在切换会话，等待登记数据同步"}}}},
    "Receiving session model output": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在接收会话的模型输出"}}}},
    "Hook event does not confirm the current task state": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hook 事件尚不能确认当前任务状态"}}}},
    "Permission was requested; return to the terminal to check its current state": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"曾发出权限请求，请返回终端确认当前状态"}}}},
    "Hook progress is stale": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hook 进展数据已过期"}}}},
    "Hook event order is ambiguous": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法确认 Hook 事件的先后顺序"}}}},
    "Gemini Hook session identity is ambiguous": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法确定 Gemini Hook 的会话身份"}}}},
    "Gemini Hook recording location could not be verified": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法核验 Gemini Hook 的记录位置"}}}},
    "Mistral Vibe observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mistral Vibe 观察器"}}}},
    "Read-only tool observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只读工具观察器"}}}},
    "Select a Vibe home folder to configure the observer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 Vibe 配置目录以安装观察器"}}}},
    "Choose the official Vibe CLI in Agents first": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先在 Agent 设置中选择官方 Vibe CLI"}}}},
    "Select the VIBE_HOME folder": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 VIBE_HOME 配置目录"}}}},
    "Select Node.js 24 or newer": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择 Node.js 24 或更新版本的可执行文件"}}}},
    "A Python-based Vibe 2.25.0 installation is required": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要基于 Python 安装的官方 Vibe 2.25.0"}}}},
    "Checking and backing up observer configuration…": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在检查并备份观察器配置…"}}}},
    "Observer installed. Restart Vibe to load it.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器已安装。请重启 Vibe 以加载配置。"}}}},
    "Observer removed. Backups and private script copies are retained.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器配置已移除，备份及私有脚本副本仍保留。"}}}},
    "Observer configuration failed. Review the current settings and available backups.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"观察器配置失败。请检查现有设置，并查看可用的备份。"}}}},
    "Configuration outcome is uncertain. Review the current settings and backups.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置操作结果尚不确定。请检查当前设置和备份。"}}}},
    "Configuration backup": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"配置备份"}}}},
    "Original settings are retained for manual recovery": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"原始设置已保留，可手动恢复"}}}},
    "Show backup": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显示备份"}}}},
    "Requires Vibe 2.25.0 and Node.js 24+. Choose VIBE_HOME explicitly. Only tool events are observable; approval and successful completion are not confirmed. Other hooks are preserved and configuration is backed up.": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要 Vibe 2.25.0 和 Node.js 24+，请明确选择 VIBE_HOME。仅观察工具事件，不能确认审批或任务成功。保留其他 Hook，并在修改前备份配置。"}}}},
    "Copilot open-session tracker": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot 已打开会话状态"}}}},
    "Copilot process identity could not be confirmed": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法确认 Copilot 进程身份"}}}},
    "Copilot open-session tracker is missing or unreadable": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot 已打开会话状态缺失或无法读取"}}}},
    "Copilot session state is incompatible or invalid": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot 会话状态不兼容或无效"}}}},
    "Copilot event format or version is incompatible": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot 事件格式或版本不兼容"}}}},
    "Copilot event log is unreadable or incomplete": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot 事件记录无法读取或尚未写入完整"}}}},
    "Copilot session tab cannot be selected precisely": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法精确选择 Copilot 会话标签页"}}}},
    "Qwen session registry + transcript": {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Qwen 会话登记与聊天记录"}}}},
