            "value": "已安装到 Applications"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs a Notification hook into ~/.claude/settings.json after writing a backup. It observes explicit attention events and never answers them unless Labs control is separately enabled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "先备份，再向 ~/.claude/settings.json 安装通知 Hook。仅观察明确的待处理事件，除非另行启用 Labs 控制，否则不会回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installs LoopFwd's bundled read-only observer through the official dsh profile plugin command. Profile metadata is backed up first. The observer writes a 0600 local snapshot with bounded titles and latest messages; it never copies API keys, tool arguments, cookies, or full transcripts. Restart the Web profile after installing or removing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过官方 dsh profile 插件命令安装随附的只读 Observer，并先备份 Profile 元数据。插件写入权限为 0600 的本机快照，标题与最新消息均限长；不复制 API Key、工具参数、Cookie 或完整对话。安装或移除后需重启 Web profile。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrations": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "集成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Integrations remain experimental until their specific CLI or Desktop surface passes real release checks. Installed software is not proof of working observation or control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各 CLI 或桌面运行表面通过实机验收前，均保持实验支持。检测到软件不代表观察或控制能力已验证。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
